### Step-by-Step Deployment Guide

```
Step 1: Scrape & Provision (5 min)
Scaffold Vite+React+Hono ──> wrangler d1/r2 create (ss-prod-*) ──> Run 0001_init.sql

Step 2: AI Gateway & Variables (3 min)
Create ss-ai-gateway in dashboard ──> Bind in wrangler.jsonc ──> Add REGRID_API_KEY secret

Step 3: Build & Deploy (2 min)
npm run build ──> npx wrangler deploy ──> Live at sunscapes-app.<subdomain>.workers.dev

Step 4: Zero Trust Access Lock (3 min)
Cloudflare Access Policy ──> Restrict to @gmail.com team list ──> Test One-Time PIN on phone

```

1. **Scaffold Repository & Provision Isolated Cloudflare Resources:**
Initialize the full-stack repository using `npm create cloudflare@latest sunscapeslandscape -- --template=cloudflare/templates/vite-react-template`. Run `npx wrangler d1 create ss-prod-db`, `npx wrangler r2 bucket create ss-prod-assets`, and `npx wrangler vectorize create ss-prod-zoning --dimensions=768 --metric=cosine`. Apply the SQL migration to create the isolated schema.


2. **Configure Cloudflare AI Gateway & Environment Secrets:**
In your Cloudflare dashboard, navigate to **AI → AI Gateway**, create a gateway named `ss-ai-gateway`, and turn on 24-hour response caching. Run `npx wrangler secret put REGRID_API_KEY` to securely store your parcel data API key.


3. **Build Assets & Deploy to Workers:**
Run `npm run build` to compile the React frontend into `./dist/client`. Execute `npx wrangler deploy` to push the unified Hono API and static assets to `https://sunscapes-app.<your-worker-subdomain>.workers.dev`.


4. **Configure Cloudflare Zero Trust (Access) for Employee Auth:**
In the Cloudflare Zero Trust Dashboard, go to **Access → Applications → Add an Application (Self-Hosted)**. Set the domain to your Worker URL (`sunscapes-app.<subdomain>.workers.dev`). Add an Access Policy rule with **Action: Allow**, **Include: Emails / Emails ending in**, and specify the authorized Sunscapes `@gmail.com` addresses. Enable One-Time PIN or Google login so your team can access the system securely on mobile and desktop without passwords.
